				<wikidot:authorName>AfroSmileyFace</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5915754</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>My eyes have been open and I see the truth now.</p> <p>This transcends all truths in the universe including SCP-001.</p> <p>Every time I laugh at this, another shark gets punched. And I laughed a lot.</p> 
