					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-402955#post-4599276</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-402955/10:30-a-m#post-4599276</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2020 20:21:56 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>SharpEmbrace</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6032914</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I feel like this should be the goal for GoI introductions. It is <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">dripping</span> - no, that's an understatement - positively flowing with consistently portrayed character and personality. This is also incredibly succinct: it wastes no time in establishing the tone and theme of the SPC. Punching sharks is paramount above all else, so that dominates the initiation. The humour is on-point and fast-paced right up to the one-liner conclusion. I love this to bits.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
